---
permalink: /concepts/bento/index.html
station: home
bodyClass: is-home
seoTitle: "Voice Overs, Radio, Advertising & Commercial Production | Overnight Radio Inc."
seoDescription: "Independent production house for GREAT Radio Commercials, Jingles & Ads the very next day!"
---
{%- set sample = collections.spots | first -%}
<section class="wrap bento bento--hero">
  <article class="tile tile--hero reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="live"></span> London, Ontario, Canada</p>
    <h1 class="display">Welcome to Overnight Radio Inc.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A commercial production house delivering top quality radio ads...<em>the very next day.</em></p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn--accent" href="{{ cbase }}/services.html">Learn more <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ cbase }}/work.html">Our Work</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="tile tile--stat reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Founded in</p>
    <p class="stat" data-count="1998" data-plain>1998</p>
  </article>

  <article class="tile tile--stat tile--accent reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Over</p>
    <p class="stat" data-count="50000">50,000</p>
    <p class="tile__foot">spots delivered</p>
  </article>

  <article class="tile tile--dark tile--player reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light"><span class="live live--light"></span> Now playing · {{ sample.data.title }} spot</p>
    {% set p = { mp3: sample.data.spotMp3, ogg: sample.data.spotOgg, label: "Sample" } %}
    {% include "concepts/bento/player.njk" %}
    <a class="tile__link" href="{{ cbase }}/work.html">Our Work, Our Pride <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
  </article>

  <a class="tile tile--team reveal" href="{{ cbase }}/team.html">
    <span class="faces" aria-hidden="true">{% for m in collections.talent %}{% if loop.index <= 6 %}<img src="{{ (m.data.cardPhoto or m.data.photo) | asset }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{% endfor %}<b>+{{ collections.talent.length - 6 }}</b></span>
    <span class="tile__title">Meet the <i>Team</i></span>
    <span class="tile__foot">{{ collections.talent.length }} voices &amp; the production team <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></span>
  </a>

  <article class="tile tile--world reveal">
    <span class="globe" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="eyebrow">Servicing clients around the world ...</p>
    <p class="tile__title">From North America to Europe ... And Australia to Asia</p>
  </article>

  <a class="tile tile--calc reveal" href="{{ cbase }}/calculator.html">
    <span class="eyebrow">Script Calculator</span>
    <span class="tile__title">How long will your commercial be?</span>
    <span class="calc-mini" aria-hidden="true"><b>0:30</b><i></i></span>
  </a>

  <a class="tile tile--price reveal" href="{{ cbase }}/services.html">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our Services</span>
    <span class="tile__title">Per spot pricing starts at <b>$175</b></span>
    <span class="tile__foot">Monthly packages &amp; rates <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></span>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="wrap about">
  <div class="about__head reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h2 class="h2">What Overnight Radio Can Do <i>For You</i></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="about__body">
    <p class="lead reveal">Whether you’re a radio station, a media group, a podcaster, steaming audio productions, or a private business, we can be of service to you... for commercial voice overs, radio commercial production and radio commercial scripts.</p>
    <p class="reveal">We serve clients all over the world, from Toronto to Miami to Vancouver, the Caribbean, Europe to Dubai. We can provide you high quality radio ads. All produced from our studios in London, Canada, west of Toronto.</p>
    <p class="reveal">Since 1998, Overnight Radio has been delivering high end commercial productions.</p>
    <p class="reveal">We help stations have more commercial voice overs to choose from, expand station creative departments by providing commercial script writing and production... all for much less than adding staff, paying benefits, etc.</p>
    <p class="reveal">And we help businesses looking for a sound that will cut through the radio waves... working directly to create effective radio commercials that will make you well known in your market.</p>
    <p class="reveal">Anything to do with creating a radio commercial... we are your team... we’ve been honing our talents for more than two decades.</p>
    <p class="callout reveal">For radio commercial production, scripts and voice overs... put our experience and low rates to work for you. <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call</a> or <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email</a> today.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="marquee" aria-label="What our Clients say">
  <div class="marquee__track">
    {# the shorter client quotes scroll past; the full set is on Our Work #}
    {% for round in [1, 2] %}{% for t in testimonials %}{% if t.quote | length < 170 %}<figure class="marquee__item"{% if round == 2 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}><blockquote>“{{ t.quote }}”</blockquote>{% if t.name %}<figcaption>{{ t.name }}</figcaption>{% endif %}</figure>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
